From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|frjósa}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*freusaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*prews-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*prus-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfrjouːsa/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ouːsa|lang=is}}

