==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*freusaną}}, whence also Old English {{m|ang|frēosan}}, Old Saxon and Old High German {{m|goh|friosan}}. Ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|non}} {{m|ine-pro|*prews-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*prus-}}.

===Verb===
{{non-verb|fraus|frusu|frosinn}}

# to [[freeze]]

